class=\"slide-item\">\n                  <h1>Investor Relations</h1>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"slide-item\">\n                  \n                                      <div id=\"block-gbhomeheaderintrotext\" class=\"block-content--nir-global-block block-content--nir-global-block--6596 block--block-contentcaaac3c1-f2d2-4bcc-87fb-8da0757d8560 block--block-contentcaaac3c1-f2d2-4bcc-87fb-8da0757d8560--5806 block--home-header-intro-text--block-content--caaac3c1-f2d2-4bcc-87fb-8da0757d8560 block--home-header-intro-text--block-content--caaac3c1-f2d2-4bcc-87fb-8da0757d8560--5806 block--8458f875-a507-4d62-ae2d-5fad41bf7820 block--8458f875-a507-4d62-ae2d-5fad41bf7820--5806 block block-block-content block-block-contentcaaac3c1-f2d2-4bcc-87fb-8da0757d8560\">\n  \n    \n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-nir-global-block-node field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">  \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-nir-global-block-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>Incorporating innovative technology inspired by the telecom industry the Cytek\u00ae Aurora and Northern Lights\u2122 full spectrum flow cytometry systems offer many advantages over conventional flow cytometers.</p>\n</div>\n      \n</div>\n      \n  </div>\n\n                  \n                </li>\n\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n\n          \n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n    \n\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"large-12 columns\">\n        <div id=\"ndq-content\" class=\"ndq-5806\">\n            <div class=\"region region-content\">\n    <div data-drupal-messages-fallback class=\"hidden\"></div>\n\n<div id=\"block-nir-pid4248-content\" class=\"block--system-main-block block--system-main-block--5806 block--content--system-main-block block--content--system-main-block--5806 block--edef63f5-57bc-4dc3-94cf-e737272b1358 block--edef63f5-57bc-4dc3-94cf-e737272b1358--5806 block block-system block-system-main-block\">\n  \n    \n      <article class=\"node node--type-nir_landing_page node--view-mode-full clearfix\">\n  <div>\n    \n\n<div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"medium-6 large-7 columns home-profile\">\n      <div class=\"block-region-header\"><div class=\"block-content--nir-global-block block-content--nir-global-block--6116 block--block-contentf390be37-9ad7-4a7e-a354-7aad647bf74c block--block-contentf390be37-9ad7-4a7e-a354-7aad647bf74c--5806 block--header--block-content--f390be37-9ad7-4a7e-a354-7aad647bf74c block--header--block-content--f390be37-9ad7-4a7e-a354-7aad647bf74c--5806 block--62a3f554-e81b-4368-97e5-6d45e942029b block--62a3f554-e81b-4368-97e5-6d45e942029b--5806 block block-block-content block-block-contentf390be37-9ad7-4a7e-a354-7aad647bf74c\">\n  \n      <h2>Corporate Profile</h2>\n    \n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-nir-global-block-node field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">  \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-nir-global-block-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>Cytek Biosciences, Inc. is a leading cell analysis solutions company advancing the next generation of cell analysis tools by delivering high-resolution, high-content and high-sensitivity cell analysis utilizing its patented Full Spectrum Profiling\u2122 (FSP\u2122) technology. Cytek\u2019s novel approach harnesses the power of information within the entire spectrum of a fluorescent signal to achieve a higher level of multiplexing with exquisite sensitivity. Cytek\u2019s FSP platform includes its core instruments, the Aurora and Northern Lights\u2122 systems, the Aurora CS cell sorter, reagents, software and services to provide a comprehensive and integrated suite of solutions for its customers. Cytek is headquartered in Fremont, California with offices and distribution channels across the globe.</p>\n\n<p>Other than Cytek\u2019s Northern Lights CLC system, which is available for clinical use in China and the European Union, Cytek\u2019s products are for research use only \u2013 not for use in diagnostic procedures.</p></div>\n      \n</div>\n      \n  </div>\n</div>\n    </div>\n  \n      <div class=\"medium-6 large-5 columns home-stock-info\">\n      <div class=\"\">\n        <div class=\"block-region-column1\"><div data-storage-id=\"node:5806:full:21206\" data-uuid=\"ef6147b4-5c48-4bb5-a249-efadc198f426\" class=\"block--market-data-block__stock-quote block--market-data-block__stock-quote--5806 block--column1--market-data-block__stock-quote block--column1--market-data-block__stock-quote--5806 block--ef6147b4-5c48-4bb5-a249-efadc198f426 block--ef6147b4-5c48-4bb5-a249-efadc198f426--5806 block block-nir-market-data-block block-market-data-block__stock-quote\">\n  \n      <h2>Stock Information</h2>\n    \n      \n<div class='stock-quote stock-quote__short'>\n    <div class=\"quote-wrapper\">\n                                                                \n            <div class=\"column medium-7\">\n                            </div>\n            <div class=\"column medium-5 end\">\n                                           </div>\n            </div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n  </div>\n\n<div class=\"block--nir-stock-chart block--nir-stock-chart--5806 block--column1--nir-stock-chart block--column1--nir-stock-chart--5806 block--1505a3dd-5e5e-43ef-a568-e41ed4b2951a block--1505a3dd-5e5e-43ef-a568-e41ed4b2951a--5806 block block-nir-stock-chart\">\n  \n    \n      \n<img src=\"https://api.nasdaqomx.wallst.com/api/chart?display=mountain&symbol=CTKB.O-CTKB&scale=linear&duration=1dy&frequency=5min&gridLine=h&bgColor=508484&lineColor=ffffff&fillcolor=508484|508484&width=408&height=182&headerType=&amp;volume=0&amp;bdrColor=508484&amp;gridLineColor=739d9d&amp;fillOpacity=10&amp;fontColor-C0=FFFFFF&amp;fontColor-C1=FFFFFF&amp;lineSizePrimary=2\" width=\"408\" height=\"182\" ></img>\n\n  </div>\n\n<div class=\"block--attribution-block__stock-info-attribution__th